# Everything here regenerates from a run. Nothing in this directory is
# an input except the scripts, docker-compose.yml, and seed_img/ (the
# palette-matched demo images the themes attach as featured images).
#
# The scorecards used to be tracked on the theory that they were "the
# durable record" — but a JSON blob of one run's numbers is a claim
# nobody can check without re-running, and the findings that matter
# live in commit messages and memory instead. The screenshots were
# never covered by a rule at all: look.py started writing shots/ and
# 7 MB of PNGs accumulated a run at a time.
themes/
raw/
shots/
fp.html
ref.html
look.json
results.json
controls.json
iterated-*.json
